o/open-telemetry/demo:2.2.0-flagd-ui" already present on machine\n4m21s       Normal    Created             pod/flagd-79c4c6cb44-p24g5              Created container: flagd-ui\n4m21s       Normal    Started             pod/flagd-79c4c6cb44-p24g5              Started container flagd-ui\n76s         Warning   NodeNotReady        pod/flagd-79c4c6cb44-p24g5              Node is not ready\n4m53s       Normal    SuccessfulCreate    replicaset/flagd-79c4c6cb44             Created pod: flagd-79c4c6cb44-p24g5\n4m53s       Normal    ScalingReplicaSet   deployment/flagd           ... [truncated]', id='755c33f9-b639-4da3-aff5-bf762f687d19', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-b47820d4811cb49a'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='780c00a8-d6e1-48d0-8c92-a452c75c1337')]]
